{%- set slug = theme.repository | replace(from="https://github.com/", to="") -%}
{%- set owner = slug | split(pat="/") | first -%}
{%- set first = variants.0 -%}
# {{ theme.name }} Neovim Theme

> [!IMPORTANT]
> This repository is a read-only mirror.
> Issues, pull requests, and stars should go to [{{ slug }}]({{ theme.repository }}).

Neovim colorscheme for {{ theme.name }}. {{ theme.description }}

## Installation

### lazy.nvim

```lua
{
    "{{ owner }}/{{ theme.id }}-nvim",
    config = function()
        require("{{ theme.id }}").setup({ variant = "{{ first.variant.id }}" })
        vim.cmd.colorscheme("{{ theme.id }}")
    end,
}
```

To pin a specific version:

```lua
{
    "{{ owner }}/{{ theme.id }}-nvim",
    tag = "v0.9.0",
    config = function()
        require("{{ theme.id }}").setup({ variant = "{{ first.variant.id }}" })
        vim.cmd.colorscheme("{{ theme.id }}")
    end,
}
```

### vim-plug

```vim
Plug '{{ owner }}/{{ theme.id }}-nvim'
```

Then in your config:

```lua
lua require("{{ theme.id }}").setup({ variant = "{{ first.variant.id }}" })
colorscheme {{ theme.id }}
```

### dein.vim

```vim
call dein#add('{{ owner }}/{{ theme.id }}-nvim')
```

Then in your config:

```lua
lua require("{{ theme.id }}").setup({ variant = "{{ first.variant.id }}" })
colorscheme {{ theme.id }}
```

